<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>GameNight</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>GameNight</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
            <a href="/register">Register</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h2>Your community board game library</h2>
        <p>Browse, borrow, and manage a shared collection of board games — no more wondering where Monopoly went.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="cta-button">Get Started</a>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>🎲 Browse the Catalog</h3>
            <p>See what's available, filter by genre, players, or difficulty.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>📋 Borrow & Track</h3>
            <p>Request a game, keep track of what you've borrowed and when it's due.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>🔔 Join the Waitlist</h3>
            <p>Game's taken? Join the queue and get it automatically when it's returned.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>